\f2\b \cf2 \cb3 What went wrong.
\f0\b0  A few seconds in, Chrome marked the trionn tab as hidden, and it stayed that way for the rest of the session. That freezes the site's animations, so I could only watch the motion live for the first few seconds. Instead, I read the timings, easing curves, travel distances, scroll triggers and pinned scroll lengths from the site's own JavaScript and CSS. Nearly all of those values are exact, but they're tagged 
\f1\fs25\fsmilli12600 \cf4 \cb5 \strokec4 [read]
