\f2\b \cf2 \cb3 The most useful findings for the rebuild:
\f0\b0 \cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Scaling:
\f0\b0  the whole site scales with the screen width through one line of CSS that sets the base text size as a fraction of the viewport. The tokens file has the exact breakpoints.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Text reveal:
\f0\b0  text comes into focus in place, unblurring from 12px over 0.8s, with letters or words appearing in random order 50ms apart.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Section handovers:
\f0\b0  sections hand over with a five-band stripe wipe in the next section's colour. The next section is pulled up underneath, so there's no seam.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Work becoming services:
\f0\b0  one pinned stage shows the work, then turns into the services section. It holds the page for 13.5 screen-heights of scrolling.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Loader:
\f0\b0  it runs for about 6 seconds on every load and only waits on a timer, not on anything loading. The first readable words appear 7.5 to 8 seconds after the page opens.\cb1 \
